# Custom entity aliases for triage/trends normalization.
#
# Copy this file to entity_aliases.yaml (gitignored) and add entries to
# make entity-overlap dedup and trend tracking treat naming variants of
# the same actor as one entity. Keys and values are matched/produced
# after lowercasing and stripping periods (e.g. "U.S." -> "us").
#
# This file is empty by default and intentionally not version-controlled,
# so you can tailor it to whichever actors/regions your channels cover
# without that list being visible in the public repo.
#
# Example format (replace with entities relevant to your channels):
# acronym: canonical name
# alternate spelling: canonical name
